Apply form is not in the snapshot fixture (greenhouse_2026-05-22 contains only the job-posting HTML; the live Greenhouse apply route was never captured), and the in-page Apply button was destroyed when the React SPA hydrated and replaced the SSR markup with "Page not found / job board no longer active". chrome-devtools is interaction-capable (click, fill, upload exist), so this is environment-gated, not MCP-capability-gated.
